.env.production.local

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.idea
# package-lock.json is COMMITTED, deliberately. It was ignored here
# among .idea and log files, with no comment, which reads as inherited
# boilerplate rather than a decision. Without it CI resolves newer
# dependency versions than any developer has, and MUI DataGrid then
# fails 9 traceability tests with "Failed to execute 'contains' on
# 'Node'" — proven by running the same suite in the same container
# with and without the lock: 9 failures vs 29 passes.

# WP-063: Playwright E2E — real login storage state (has live tokens) and
# generated run artifacts, never committed.
/e2e/.auth
/e2e-report
/e2e-results
/playwright-report
/test-results
